# tof_recover_landing_invalid.scn — samples come back DURING the blind landing, but all of them are invalid
#                                   ToF なしの着陸の「最中」にサンプルが戻るが、全部が無効
#
# The ToF stops while hovering at 0.5 m (14.0 s) -> LANDING by silence, blind descent. 0.3 s into that
# LANDING (the craft is still ~0.4 m up) the sensor's output returns, but every sample is INVALID (`tof_invalid`: a
# floor material it cannot range). If the tracker counted an invalid sample as AGREEMENT whenever the craft was not
# flying (LANDING included), then after ~1 s the estimator would be declared "re-acquired" with nothing but invalid samples,
# the silence episode would end and the blind descent would be given up in the air. Spec under test:
#  1. In LANDING an invalid sample counts as evidence (the last valid height, 0.5 m, is above kTofInvalidLandingMinHeightM
#     = 0.10 m), not as agreement: 0.5 s after the samples return Failsafe judges InvalidStuck (log "silence episode: only
#     invalid samples while flying") and the episode lasts until the craft is down.
#  2. The blind landing goes on to the touchdown (IDLE_GROUND) at a bounded speed; it is not given up in the air.
#
# 0.5 m のホバー中（14.0 s）に ToF が停止 → 出力停止による LANDING、ToF なしの降下。その
# LANDING の 0.3 s 後（機体はまだ約 0.4 m 上）にセンサの出力が戻るが、全サンプルが「無効」（`tof_invalid`:
# 測距できない床材）。追跡器が、機体が飛行中でなければ（LANDING を含む）無効サンプルを「一致」と数えると、
# 約 1 s 後に無効サンプルだけで推定器が「取り込み直し済み」と判定され、出力停止のエピソードが終わり、
# ToF なしの降下が空中で放棄されてしまう。検証する仕様: (1) LANDING では無効サンプルは一致でなく証拠として数える
# （最後の有効な高さ 0.5 m は kTofInvalidLandingMinHeightM = 0.10 m 以上）: サンプルが戻って 0.5 s 後に Failsafe が
# InvalidStuck と判定し（ログ "silence episode: only invalid samples while flying"）、エピソードは機体が降りるまで続く。(2) ToF なしの
# 着陸は接地（IDLE_GROUND）まで続き、有界の速度で降りる。空中で放棄されない。
#
# Run: sf sils scenario simulator/sils/scenarios/tof_recover_landing_invalid.scn --target vehicle --duration 22000000
#
#  <t>  ch          <thr> <roll> <pitch> <yaw> <arm> <hold_ms> <rate_hz> <alt> <acro> <pos>
   0    rc           2048  2048   2048    2048  0     6000      50                       # A: boot at rest — calibration completes
   +    rc           2048  2048   2048    2048  0     1500      50        1              # B: ALT switch ON while DISARMED
   +    rc           2048  2048   2048    2048  1     1000      50        1              # C: ARM in ALT_HOLD (7.5 s) — spool, then the auto-takeoff climb
   +    rc           2048  2048   2048    2048  1     5500      50        1              # D: climb to 0.5 m and hold (to 14.0 s)
   +    tof_silent   1                                                                   # E: 14.0 s — ToF output stops while hovering
   +    rc           2048  2048   2048    2048  1     600       50        1              # F: LANDING by silence (~14.3 s), blind descent under way (to 14.6 s)
   +    tof_invalid  1                                                                   # G: 14.6 s — from now on every sample is invalid ...
   +    tof_silent   0                                                                   # H: 14.6 s — ... and the samples are back
   +    rc           2048  2048   2048    2048  1     7000      50        1              # I: blind descent to the touchdown, then settle (to 21.6 s)
